{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "0a95309c061ed4d0010db28a7a4fe9478dc999f45a827edfe23d353fac0afb41", "documents": [{"id": "offline-0a95309c061ed4d0010d", "filename": "19-Part C.mp3", "sha256": "0a95309c061ed4d0010db28a7a4fe9478dc999f45a827edfe23d353fac0afb41", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-5/0a95309c061ed4d0010db28a7a4fe9478dc999f45a827edfe23d353fac0afb41.mp3", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/0a95309c061ed4d0010db28a7a4fe9478dc999f45a827edfe23d353fac0afb41.json", "format": "mp3", "role": "recording"}, {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1TRNy6ITkqnUIvtYwzrn1x2psVcW252J3-C-1", "label": "Jahshan set 19 · Part C · Extract 1", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [213], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "What is the main focus of Sally's talk on tetanus?\nSelect one:\nA. It is impossible to avoid tetanus bacteria.\nB. It is essential to be vaccinated against tetanus.\nC. It is important to develop natural tetanus immunity.", "sourcePage": 213, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "Sally believes that deaths from tetanus still occur because\nSelect one:\nA. the bacteria is about to infect a person through the tiniest of wounds.\nB. infected people don't seek medical treatment early enough.\nC. not enough people are immunised against tetanus.", "sourcePage": 213, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "Why do some people believe the tetanus vaccine isn't necessary?\nSelect one:\nA. Tetanus bacteria can't enter a person's bloodstream.\nB. Tetanus bacteria are everywhere, giving people natural immunity.\nC. Tetanus bacteria aren't affected by medication or vaccination.", "sourcePage": 213, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "Sally suggests the woman didn't understand the dangers of tetanus because\nSelect one:\nA. she hasn't undergone a recent vaccination.\nB. she sought medical treatment very late.\nC. she ignored many early warning signs.", "sourcePage": 213, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "Sally highlights the case of the 4-year-old boy to\nSelect one:\nA. explain the symptoms of tetanus infection.\nB. show how tetanus can affect small children.\nC. illustrate how difficult it is to diagnose tetanus.", "sourcePage": 213, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "Why does Sally believe the man's case highlights how everyone is at risk of tetanus?\nSelect one:\nA. Because he arrived at hospital with no health complaints.\nB. Because the man had no injuries, but he still had tetanus.\nC. Because he couldn't remember when he was immunised\n\nC5.2", "sourcePage": 213, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["0a95309c061ed4d0010db28a7a4fe9478dc999f45a827edfe23d353fac0afb41"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}, {"id": "jahshan-1TRNy6ITkqnUIvtYwzrn1x2psVcW252J3-C-2", "label": "Jahshan set 19 · Part C · Extract 2", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [214], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "DrMene suggests that her role as CMO required her to\nSelect one:\nA. use a range of care options to assist athletic performance.\nB. work longer hours than usual to manage all the injuries.\nC. exercise sympathy because it was busy for everyone.", "sourcePage": 214, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "DrMene says the medical support of athletes\nSelect one:\nA. was tailored to the specific needs of the individual.\nB. was the same as treating patients at a medical clinic.\nC. depended on the type of health care provider available.", "sourcePage": 214, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "What is DrMene's view on providing care for life-threatening injuries?\nSelect one:\nA. A level of team work would have ensured a positive outcome.\nB. They knew there wouldn't be any to attend at the Olympics.\nC. If they had occurred, flexible treatment would have been required.", "sourcePage": 214, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "DrMene says her team prevented injuries by\nSelect one:\nA. reducing the amount of competition and travel for each athlete.\nB. evaluating what athletes ate and what they did after competing.\nC. having more advanced technology than other competing nations.", "sourcePage": 214, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "DrMene was impressed with he software they used because\nSelect one:\nA. it was particularly useful for musculoskeletal injuries.\nB. it had tremendous communication potential.\nC. it can help in critical care situations.", "sourcePage": 214, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "DrMene thinks any physician wanting to treat athletes at a major sporting event should\nSelect one:\nA. understand that you won't make a lot of money doing it.\nB. apply what they learn at these events to their private practice.\nC. take the time to forge connections that enhance your reputation.", "sourcePage": 214, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["0a95309c061ed4d0010db28a7a4fe9478dc999f45a827edfe23d353fac0afb41"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
